{"node_id": "LVMC_11_60_030_A4", "law_refs": ["LVMC-11-60-030-A4"], "subject": {"binder": "subject", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-030::bus"]}, "segmentation": [{"id": "c1", "text": "The operator of a bus,", "role": "subject"}, {"id": "c2", "text": "other than a tour bus,", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "c3", "text": "shall: Enter a bus stop, bus stand, passenger loading zone or origin or destination point", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "c4", "text": "on a public street", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "c5", "text": "in such a manner that the bus when stopped to load or unload passengers or baggage", "role": "trigger"}, {"id": "c6", "text": "shall be in a position with the right-hand front wheel of such vehicle not farther than eighteen inches from the curb", "role": "obligation"}, {"id": "c7", "text": "and the bus approximately parallel to the curb so as not to unduly impede the movement of other vehicular traffic.", "role": "standard"}], "elements": [{"span": "c1", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-030::bus"], "derived": [], "justification": "'bus' is admitted as DEF-NRS-484A-030::bus; ru.aggregate is 'membership of a legal aggregate'; 'the operator of' is a relational role, never membership."}, {"span": "c2", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-LVMC-11-02-150::tour_bus"], "derived": [], "justification": "'tour bus' is admitted as DEF-LVMC-11-02-150::tour_bus; ru.aggregate is 'membership of a legal aggregate'."}, {"span": "c3", "atoms": ["st.curb_zone", "st.transit_stop", "rel.occupies"], "derived": [], "justification": "The places the bus enters: a bus stop is st.transit_stop ('a bus stop, bench, shelter or platform for public transport passengers') or st.curb_zone kind bus_stop ('a signed or marked length of curb'); a bus stand ('a fixed area in or adjacent to the highway to be occupied exclusively by buses', DEF-NRS-484A-035) and an origin or destination point are posted bus places, the signed bus zone, st.curb_zone kind bus_stop; a passenger loading zo